jobs.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Lead Legal Counsel, Corporate, you&#39;ll own securities, public company reporting, and corporate governance work for GitLab, a growing public technology company. You&#39;ll join the Legal &amp;amp; Corporate Affairs (LACA) team as a senior individual contributor, reporting to the Senior Director, Associate General Counsel, Corporate &amp;amp; Compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll bring a strong securities law foundation and a broad corporate perspective to a small team. Your work will span quarterly reporting and earnings, the annual proxy statement and stockholders meeting, board and committee matters, equity plans, and subsidiary governance. You&#39;ll also support mergers and acquisitions (M&amp;amp;A) and other strategic initiatives.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll work closely with Accounting, Corporate Development, Finance, Investor Relations, People, Product, Stock Administration, Tax, and Treasury. You&#39;ll translate complex legal issues into clear recommendations, build trust across functions, and balance legal risk with business objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This is a remote role open to candidates anywhere in the United States. We have a preference for candidates based in the San Francisco Bay Area, but we welcome applications from all US locations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own securities and public company reporting matters, working with internal stakeholders and external auditors on Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) filings, quarterly reports, earnings releases, the annual proxy statement, investor presentations, and other public disclosures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on corporate governance, including board and committee processes, the annual stockholders meeting, corporate approvals, equity plan matters, executive compensation, and related compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide legal guidance on complex entity matters across jurisdictions, including formation, maintenance, reorganizations, intercompany agreements, and wind-downs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support M&amp;amp;A and other strategic transactions, contributing to diligence, documentation, approvals, signing, closing, and post-closing integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and manage outside counsel across jurisdictions, coordinating work and ensuring practical, high-quality, and cost-effective advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify legal and business risks, present clear options to senior stakeholders, and monitor legal developments to keep policies, processes, and controls current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve playbooks, checklists, templates, and workflows for recurring corporate legal work. Train junior legal team members and cross-functional partners to use these resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of demonstrated relevant legal experience, including law firm experience advising US-listed public companies on securities law, corporate governance, and public company reporting. Prior in-house experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Juris Doctor (JD) degree and active admission to a US state bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to independently manage complex legal matters and cross-functional projects, prioritize competing needs, and drive work to completion with limited direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, including the ability to explain technical legal issues to non-lawyers and senior leaders and build trusted working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to investigate unfamiliar legal questions, weigh risks against business objectives, and turn recommendations into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving legal processes, templates, policies, or other scalable resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to collaborate in a remote, globally distributed team across time zones and cultures, and willingness to use GitLab in your day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helpful but not required: in-house work at a public software-as-a-service (SaaS), software, or open core company; M&amp;amp;A; cross-border corporate matters; outside counsel management; or legal technology that helps scale legal work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Corporate &amp;amp; Compliance team supports principled corporate governance and GitLab&#39;s culture of compliance. We work with leaders and subject matter experts across LACA and the broader company to provide practical, timely legal guidance.&amp;nbsp;LACA is a globally distributed team that supports GitLab&#39;s growth through legal expertise, business partnership, and continuous process improvement. We work transparently, collaborate across functions and time zones, and use GitLab&#39;s own tools and AI-enabled workflows to make legal support more efficient and accessible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab will support you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/paid-time-off/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/erg-guide/#:~:text=Definition%20of%20the%20TMRG%20%2D%20Team%20Member%20Resource%20Groups,-TMRGs%20are%20voluntary&amp;amp;text=The%20purpose%20for%20this%20type,developing%20the%20sense%20of%20belonging.&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Parental leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/finance/expenses/#equipment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Home office&lt;/a&gt; support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$285,600 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;LTK’s mission is to empower the world’s premium lifestyle Creators to achieve maximum economic success. We have a huge opportunity ahead of us and we’re looking for team members who want to create, innovate and disrupt an industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We empower our team members to drive innovation, create value, and continue to spearhead the creation of this industry — a game changer when it comes to career growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Brand Partnerships (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London, UK&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP, Brand Partnerships (EU)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Brand Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing EU Brand Partnerships team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior commercial role responsible for driving enterprise growth across the UK through the acquisition, growth and strategic development of LTK&#39;s most valuable brand partnerships. You&#39;ll own the development of high-value relationships with leading fashion, beauty, lifestyle and luxury brands, positioning LTK as a trusted, long-term creator commerce partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As one of the UK&#39;s most senior commercial leaders, you&#39;ll lead consultative sales conversations with executive stakeholders, identifying opportunities to solve complex marketing challenges through LTK&#39;s full-funnel creator marketing solutions. You&#39;ll be responsible for building new enterprise relationships while strategically growing a portfolio of LTK Europe’s highest-potential and highest-value brand partners. Through a consultative approach, you&#39;ll develop a healthy pipeline of opportunities, convert new business and expand long-term investment across your accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Brand Activation, Creator Success, Campaign Operations and Marketing, you&#39;ll own the long-term growth of strategic brand partners, taking over once brands have successfully onboarded and transitioned through their initial activation phase to maximise retention, investment and lifetime value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an experienced enterprise seller who thrives on opening new opportunities, influencing senior decision-makers and building meaningful commercial partnerships across every level of a brand&#39;s marketing organisation—from executive leadership through to day-to-day marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Sales &amp;amp; Market Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the UK enterprise &amp;amp; mid market business strategy across fashion, beauty, lifestyle and luxury sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a healthy pipeline of high-value opportunities through strategic prospecting, networking and industry engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships across senior marketing organisations, including CMOs, Marketing Directors, Digital, Social, Affiliate and Ecommerce leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex consultative sales cycles from discovery through negotiation and contract execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position LTK as a strategic creator commerce partner by delivering insight-led, value-based sales conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed ambitious Managed Services and Advertising revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow a portfolio of strategic brand partners, identifying opportunities to increase investment across LTK&#39;s commercial solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop long-term account strategies that deepen relationships and expand LTK&#39;s footprint across multiple business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities across creator collaborations, paid media, content, licensing, events and emerging commercial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted executive relationships that position LTK as a long-term strategic marketing partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver executive business reviews, strategic recommendations and commercial proposals that support long-term partnership growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with clients to solve evolving marketing challenges through innovative creator-led solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Brand Activation to ensure a seamless transition of newly activated brands into long-term commercial management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing, Creator Success, Campaign Operations, Product and Operations to deliver an exceptional partner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share market intelligence and customer feedback to influence product development, commercial strategy and go-to-market initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of sales playbooks, enterprise outreach strategies and consultative selling best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging categories, market trends and whitespace opportunities to expand LTK&#39;s enterprise footprint across the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent LTK across the UK marketing industry by building executive-level relationships, speaking at key industry events and strengthening LTK&#39;s position as the leading creator commerce platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior commercial leader within the UK Brand Partnerships team, shaping commercial strategy, coach consultative selling and foster a culture of high performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed individual sales quotas while contributing to wider UK Business Partnerships objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data and commercial insights to continuously optimise sales strategy and pipeline health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management, forecasting and reporting through HubSpot and internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compelling, insight-led presentations and business cases tailored to executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of consumer trends, retail innovation and the evolving creator economy to identify new commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years&#39; experience in enterprise sales, strategic partnerships or business development within digital marketing, media, SaaS or influencer marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently exceeding commercial targets through enterprise new business acquisition and strategic account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative relationship builder who earns trust quickly and is comfortable influencing senior stakeholders through insight rather than transactional selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex consultative sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders and executive decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional commercial acumen with the ability to translate market trends into compelling business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding presentation, negotiation and executive communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of influencer marketing, affiliate marketing, social commerce and the evolving creator economy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable influencing cross-functional teams and collaborating across multiple business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing senior relationships across fashion, beauty, luxury and lifestyle brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly strategic while remaining hands-on and execution focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, entrepreneurial and driven to build new commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English language skills; additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset focused on seizing opportunities and moving with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedication to fierce prioritization and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability to a dynamic, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and openness to feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#LI-AJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and private pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Flexible work schedule plus Summer Fridays (workday ends at 3 pm)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;25 days holiday, plus an extra day for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A benefits and wellness scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Private medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid volunteering days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work anniversary celebrations, including extra annual holidays, and luxury gifting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interesting problems to solve with an expert team at a rapid-growth retail disruptor and the largest creator marketing platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Happy Hours and team events and activities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LTK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2011, LTK is the global technology platform purpose-built to empower lifestyle creators to monetize their content. The full-service platform connects brands, creators, and shoppers with a world-class shopping app and trusted tools and technology that make content instantly shoppable. Today, premium lifestyle creators in 150+ countries drive more than $3.6 billion in annual retail sales through their LTK Shop profiles. More than 20 million consumers turn to LTK Shops in the LTK shopping platform each month to find inspiration and instantly shop the styles recommended by their favorite creators. And, more than 6,000 brands partner with LTK to gain access to its global creator network for content that converts against performance-driven, cross-channel KPIs. LTK is headquartered in Dallas, TX, and currently operates on five continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To empower the world’s premium lifestyle Creators to achieve maximum economic success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Here to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commit to the journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work well&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;LTK believes diversity, equity, and inclusion are fundamental obligations that strengthen our team. We employ a diverse, multi-disciplinary team to build a meaningful company and culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
