&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach&lt;/strong&gt; team members through regular feedback, development support, and career growth conversations to strengthen knowledge, communication, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; with the Director of Customer Success to define team goals, clarify responsibilities, and align priorities with company direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage&lt;/strong&gt; resource assignments, staffing levels, and hiring activity to support team coverage and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop&lt;/strong&gt; senior-level relationships with customers and support the team in building trusted advisor partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; with Sales, Product Management, Engineering, Professional Services, and other internal teams to create a consistent customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support&lt;/strong&gt; customers during escalations by working with other leaders to coordinate clear, effective responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve&lt;/strong&gt; the processes and tools used by the team and oversee initiatives tied to objectives and key results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
